      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10f807b2eecd83cf493a6681",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我约她在车站前的圆环跟我碰面。\n至于要去哪里等详细内容，\n我都没告诉她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3cf5efeef1bd8220d43cfd6f3ee8121cc17a88052a62a4c55f32709c55db83b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9d4e452d3d5f792818b8d5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……太阳没有要升起，不是sunrise，\n是surprise啦，但这不是重点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ea6e9f3f4ed8011cd58b1eea24f2d402f67a9f67f047355315aa628d5f934b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100112.json",
      "json_path": [
